{"seq":3,"slug":"return-metrics","title":"投资回报指标 IRR/CoC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/real-estate-investing/valuation/return-metrics","wordCount":1776,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"投资回报指标-irr-coc\">投资回报指标 IRR/CoC</h1><p>Cap Rate 告诉你「如果全款买、只看第一年」这房子值不值，但真实的投资生活远比这复杂：你加了杠杆、持有了七年、中间提了三次租、最后还卖出获利。要回答「这整笔投资到底赚了多少」，需要一组比 Cap Rate 更精细的回报指标。它们各自回答不同的问题——有的看年度现金回报，有的看全周期年化收益，有的看资金翻了几倍。本篇是 hub 里回报指标的主讲篇，把现金回报率（CoC）、内部收益率（IRR）和股权倍数（Equity Multiple）这三件工具讲透，并说清何时该用哪一件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三种回报指标各管一段\">核心概念：三种回报指标各管一段</h2><p>这三个指标不是竞争关系，而是从不同时间尺度、是否考虑货币时间价值的角度互补。理解它们的分工，比记住公式更重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[一笔房产投资的全周期] --&gt; B[CoC 现金回报率]&#10;    A --&gt; C[IRR 内部收益率]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Equity Multiple 股权倍数]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[问题 每年现金回报率多少]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[特征 单年 含杠杆 不计时间价值]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[问题 全周期年化收益多少]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[特征 含所有现金流与卖出 计时间价值]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[问题 投入的钱翻了几倍]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[特征 总额 不计时间价值]&#10;    B2 --&gt; E[Cap Rate 的杠杆后升级版]&#10;    C2 --&gt; F[全周期黄金标准]\">flowchart TD\n    A[一笔房产投资的全周期] --&gt; B[CoC 现金回报率]\n    A --&gt; C[IRR 内部收益率]\n    A --&gt; D[Equity Multiple 股权倍数]\n    B --&gt; B1[问题 每年现金回报率多少]\n    B --&gt; B2[特征 单年 含杠杆 不计时间价值]\n    C --&gt; C1[问题 全周期年化收益多少]\n    C --&gt; C2[特征 含所有现金流与卖出 计时间价值]\n    D --&gt; D1[问题 投入的钱翻了几倍]\n    D --&gt; D2[特征 总额 不计时间价值]\n    B2 --&gt; E[Cap Rate 的杠杆后升级版]\n    C2 --&gt; F[全周期黄金标准]</pre><p>这三个指标都建立在前两篇的基础上：现金流的口径来自 <a href=\"cashflow-cap-rate\">现金流量与 Cap Rate</a>，杠杆后的月供与本金摊还来自 <a href=\"leverage-mortgage\">杠杆与抵押贷款</a>。本篇负责把这些现金流组织成可比较的回报数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"现金回报率-coc-杠杆后的当期回报\">现金回报率 CoC：杠杆后的当期回报</h2><p>现金回报率（Cash-on-Cash Return, CoC）回答最朴素的问题：「我每年从这笔投资里实际拿回多少现金，相对我实际投入的现金？」公式为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CoC</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>年度税前现金流</mtext><mtext>初始投入现金</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CoC} = \\frac{\\text{年度税前现金流}}{\\text{初始投入现金}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CoC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">初始投入现金</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年度税前现金流</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分子是 NOI 减去月供后的年度净现金流；分母是你实际掏出的钱——首付、过户费、初装修等，而非房产总价。这正是 CoC 与 Cap Rate 的关键区别：Cap Rate 用全款假设（分母是总价），CoC 用真实投入（分母是首付等自有资金），因此 CoC 把杠杆效应包含了进来。</p>\n<p>举例：一套 25 万美元的房，首付加杂费投入 6 万美元，年度税前现金流 4800 美元，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CoC</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4800</mn><mn>60000</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CoC} = \\frac{4800}{60000} = 8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CoC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60000</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4800</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span></span></span></span></span>。若同一套房的 Cap Rate 只有 5%，CoC 却有 8%，差额正是正杠杆的贡献——这与 <a href=\"leverage-mortgage\">杠杆与抵押贷款</a> 讲的正杠杆放大回报一脉相承。反之，2026 年负杠杆环境下，CoC 可能低于 Cap Rate 甚至为负。</p>\n<p>CoC 的局限和 Cap Rate 一样：它只看单一年份，忽略本金摊还带来的股权增长、增值、和卖出收益，更不考虑货币的时间价值。要补足这些，必须请出 IRR。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内部收益率-irr-全周期的黄金标准\">内部收益率 IRR：全周期的黄金标准</h2><p>IRR 是把一笔投资从买入到卖出的<strong>所有</strong>现金流——初始投入（负）、每年现金流（正）、最终卖出净收益（正，含增值与累计本金摊还后的股权）——综合成一个年化收益率。它的定义是让净现值（NPV）等于零的那个折现率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>IRR</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{IRR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IRR</span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>IRR</mtext><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{t=0}^{n} \\frac{CF_t}{(1+\\text{IRR})^t} = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9185em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IRR</span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7196em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CF_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是初始投入（负值），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CF_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 年的现金流，最后一年的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CF_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 还包含卖出所得。IRR 的强大在于它<strong>考虑了货币时间价值</strong>——早到的现金比晚到的更值钱，也整合了现金流、增值、本金摊还三个收益来源（税务收益通常在税后 IRR 中体现，见 <a href=\"../operations-risk/tax-depreciation\">税务与折旧</a>）。</p>\n<p>正因为 IRR 把一切纳入，它成了机构和成熟投资者评估全周期投资的黄金标准。一处持有 7 年、IRR 达 14% 的项目，意味着综合所有进出现金，年化回报相当于 14%。但 IRR 也有两个著名陷阱：其一，它隐含「中间现金流可按 IRR 再投资」的乐观假设，实际很难做到，可用 MIRR（修正 IRR）矫正；其二，IRR 对时间极其敏感——同样总收益，卖得越早 IRR 越高，可能诱导投资者过早退出而牺牲长期复利。</p>\n<h2 id=\"股权倍数-钱翻了几倍的直觉\">股权倍数：钱翻了几倍的直觉</h2><p>IRR 高但金额小的项目，和 IRR 中等但金额大的项目，哪个更好？IRR 本身回答不了，因为它是个比率，对绝对规模不敏感。股权倍数（Equity Multiple）补上这块拼图：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>股权倍数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>累计回收的全部现金</mtext><mtext>累计投入的全部现金</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{股权倍数} = \\frac{\\text{累计回收的全部现金}}{\\text{累计投入的全部现金}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">股权倍数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">累计投入的全部现金</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">累计回收的全部现金</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一个 2.0x 的股权倍数意味着你投入的每 1 美元，最终连本带利收回 2 美元。它直白地告诉你「钱翻了几倍」，但缺点是不含时间维度——2.0x 用 5 年实现还是用 15 年实现，含义天差地别，却是同一个数。所以股权倍数必须和 IRR 搭配看：IRR 管「年化快不快」，股权倍数管「总量大不大」。</p>\n<p>下表把三个指标的分工一览无余：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>含杠杆</th>\n<th>计时间价值</th>\n<th>时间范围</th>\n<th>主要局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cap Rate</td>\n<td>无杠杆首年回报</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>单年</td>\n<td>不反映杠杆与全周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CoC</td>\n<td>杠杆后单年现金回报</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>单年</td>\n<td>忽略增值、摊还、卖出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IRR</td>\n<td>全周期年化收益</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>全周期</td>\n<td>再投资假设、对时间敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>股权倍数</td>\n<td>钱翻了几倍</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>全周期</td>\n<td>无时间维度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"把指标串成决策-一个综合判读\">把指标串成决策：一个综合判读</h2><p>假设两个项目摆在面前。项目甲：CoC 9%，IRR 12%，股权倍数 1.5x（持有 5 年）；项目乙：CoC 4%，IRR 16%，股权倍数 2.3x（持有 8 年）。怎么选？</p>\n<p>甲的当期现金回报更高（CoC 9%），适合需要稳定被动收入、临近退休的投资者——这与 <a href=\"../strategies/buy-and-hold\">出租持有与现金流</a> 的目标契合。乙的年化收益（IRR 16%）和总倍数（2.3x）都更高，但前期现金流薄、依赖后期增值与卖出兑现，更适合能承受低现金流、追求长期资本增长的人——这与 <a href=\"../strategies/brrrr-flipping\">翻新转售与 BRRRR</a> 的增值导向更搭。</p>\n<p>这说明回报指标不是要选出「唯一最优」，而是要匹配你的投资目标与现金流承受力。任何单一指标都会误导：只看 CoC 会错过增值型机会，只看 IRR 会忽视当期生存压力，只看股权倍数会忽略时间成本。把四个指标（Cap Rate、CoC、IRR、股权倍数）连同税后口径（<a href=\"../operations-risk/tax-depreciation\">税务与折旧</a>）一起摆上桌，才是完整的房地产投资分析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三大回报指标分工互补：CoC 看杠杆后单年现金回报，IRR 看全周期年化收益，股权倍数看资金翻了几倍。</li>\n<li>CoC = 年现金流 / 初始投入现金，是 Cap Rate 的杠杆后升级版；正杠杆时 CoC &gt; Cap Rate，负杠杆时反之。</li>\n<li>IRR 让 NPV 归零，整合所有现金流、增值与本金摊还并计时间价值，是全周期黄金标准；但有再投资假设与时间敏感两大陷阱。</li>\n<li>股权倍数直观回答「翻了几倍」，但无时间维度，必须与 IRR 搭配解读。</li>\n<li>没有唯一最优指标——选指标即选投资目标：求当期现金看 CoC，求长期增值看 IRR 与股权倍数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"投资回报指标 IRR/CoC","id":"投资回报指标-irr-coc"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三种回报指标各管一段","id":"核心概念-三种回报指标各管一段"},{"level":2,"text":"现金回报率 CoC：杠杆后的当期回报","id":"现金回报率-coc-杠杆后的当期回报"},{"level":2,"text":"内部收益率 IRR：全周期的黄金标准","id":"内部收益率-irr-全周期的黄金标准"},{"level":2,"text":"股权倍数：钱翻了几倍的直觉","id":"股权倍数-钱翻了几倍的直觉"},{"level":2,"text":"把指标串成决策：一个综合判读","id":"把指标串成决策-一个综合判读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"杠杆与抵押贷款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/real-estate-investing/valuation/leverage-mortgage"},"next":{"title":"出租持有与现金流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/real-estate-investing/strategies/buy-and-hold"}}